 * @param pos the entry''s index-number. The position {@code pos} is a value from<b>1</b> to  {@link #getCount(int) getCount(ZKNCOUNT)}
 * @return {@code true} when the entry was automatically created from a bibtexfile,  {@code false} otherwise.
 */
'))
