	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 5170)
		(container (ref: 34236))
		(content '/** 
 * This method retrieves the element of a modified entry. the modified entries'' content is stored in a separated XML-Document (see  {@link #modifiedEntries modifiedEntries}. each element of this document has a timestamp-attribute that equals the timestamp-attribute of an entry in the  {@link #desktop desktop}-Document. <br> <br> So, by passing a  {@code timestamp} value, this method searches whether wehave any modified entry that has the same timestamp-attribut, and if so, it returns that element which was modified (and thus differs from an entry''s content as it is stored in the original database).
 * @param timestamp the timestamp which should match the requested entry''stimestamp-attribute
 * @return the modified entry as element, or {@code null} if no entry was found.
 */
'))
