	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 8243)
		(container (ref: 92927))
		(content '/** 
 * This method builds the cluster or keyword-relations. That means, all entries that contain <b>all</b> keywords from the tree root through the selected path are extracted and displayed in the related list. <br> <br> After all Keywords from the selected path and their related entries are set to the list, we get <b>all</b> keywords of the entries in that list. all new keywords, that do not already appear in the tree-path, are added as new children to the last selected keyword in the tree. Thus, by selecting a keyword, the related entries are shown and then the remaining related keywords are addes as new children.
 */
'))
