	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 9802)
		(container (ref: 99985))
		(content '/** 
 * This method checks, whether a given value already exist in an entry''s luhmann-tag, or in any of the entry''s sub-entries luhmann-tags. We need this to prevent infinite loops when displaying the sub-entries. An entry A may contain an entry B as sub-entry, but entry B or any of entry B''s sub-entries may not contain entry A!
 * @param firstEntry  (the entry which luhmann-tag we want to check)
 * @param secondEntry (the entry which may not part of entry''s luhmann-tag)
 * @return {@code true} when the checkvalue exists, false otherwise. actuallythe "found"-value is returned
 */
'))
