 * @param isDesktop true, when the style-definition is used for theCDesktop-frame, false otherwise
 * @param isExport true, when the style-definition is used for exportingdata, false otherwise
 * @return the style-definitions for the basic-tags in HTML-CSS-Format
 */
'))
