	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 12428)
		(container (ref: 17883))
		(content '/** 
 * This method merges two authors. The method searches for the author "oldau" in all entries. If this author was found in an entry, the method then looks for the new author "newau" in that entry. If the new author also exists, nothing is changed. If the new author does not exist, it is added to the entry. at the end, the old author is deleted from the datafile via the method "deleteAuthor()"
 * @param oldau (the old author, which should be deleted)
 * @param newau
 */
'))
