		(container (ref: 79144))
		(content '/** 
 * This method adds is a convenience method of addSubEntryToEntry to append the new sub-entry to the last position of entry''s sub-entries.
 * @param entry       the entry to which the sub-entry should be added
 * @param newSubEntry the sub-entry to be inserted
 * @return {@code true} if everything was ok, false if the addvalue alreadyexisted or if the entry indicated by "addvalue" itself already contains the entry "entry". in this case, we would have an infinitive loop, with entry A having a sub-entry B, and B having a sub-entry A again and so on...
 */
'))
