 * @param notes the initial desktop-notes that should be associated with thisdesktop. use this e.g. when importing an archived desktop (see {@link #importArchivedDesktop(org.jdom.Document) importArchivedDesktop()}. use  {@code null} when no notes-contentshould be added (i.e. the elements are being created, but they have no text).
 * @return {@code true} if the desktop was successfully added, {@code false}otherwise (e.g. because the desktop-name already existed)
