		(content '/** 
 * This method inits several listeners for our components. we do this manually instead of letting the GUI-Builder create the event-methods, because this gives a better overview and avoids having too many (event-)methods.<br> <br> Furthermore, selection listeners for the tables, trees and lists are initiated. Whenever a user makes a selection in the components on the tabbed pane, we want to react to that, either by showing the related entry or displaying other stuff.
 */
'))
