	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 31375)
		(container (ref: 10707))
		(content '/** 
 * This method merges two keywords. The method searches for the keyword "oldkw" in all entries. If this keyword was found in an entry, the method then looks for the new keyword "newkw" in that entry. If the new keyword also exists, nothing is changed. If the new keyword does not exist, it is added to the entry. at the end, the old keyword is deleted from the datafile via the method "deleteKeyword()"
 * @param oldkw (the old keyword, which should be deleted)
 * @param newkw
 */
'))
