	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 40395)
		(container (ref: 73906))
		(content '/** 
 * Ask the user whether he wants to load the original file, the newer backup-file or cancel the complete load-operation. The user is given three options:<br> <br> 1. Cancel the load altogether. We clear the current data file in the settings.<br> 2. Load the newer backup. We create a copy of the original file with a .backup extension and set the newer backup as the current data file in the settings.<br> 3. Load the original, older file. We don''t do anything, so the curent data file in the settings is kept to the original file.<br>
 * @param documentFile original file
 */
'))
