 * @param e           the element where we start scanning. for the first call,use  {@link #getDesktopElement(int) getDesktopElement(int)}to retrieve the root-element for starting the recursive scan.
 * @param entrynumber the number of the entry we are looking for. if anyelement''s id-attribut matches this parameter, the element is return, else null
 * @return an element which id-attribute matches the parameter{@code entrynumber}, or null if no element was found
 */
'))
