		(content '/** 
 * This method changes the treefold-state of a bullet-point. The <i>treefold</i>-attribute of the bullet-point is either set to {@link #TREE_FOLDING_EXPANDED TREE_FOLDING_EXPANDED} or{@link #TREE_FOLDING_COLLAPSED TREE_FOLDING_COLLAPSED}.<br> <br> With this attribute, we can check whether a bullet-point should be expanded or not, when creating the TreeView in the CDesktop-Window.
 * @param timestamp the timestamp of the bullet point which treefold-state waschanged
 * @param expanded  {@code true} if the bullet point was expanded, {@code false}if it was collapsed.
 */
'))
