		(container (ref: 50116))
		(content '/** 
 * This method retrieves all notes (resp. their ID) in the Zettelkasten that are part of a note sequence, i.e. which are top level notes in a note sequence or which have sub-ordinated notes, and returns the index numbers as integer array. <br/> <b>Caution!</b> The position  {@code zettelpos} is a value from <b>1</b> to{@link #getCount(int) getCount()} - in contrary to usual array handling wherethe range is from 0 to (size-1).
 * @return all note-IDs in the Zettelkasten that are part of a note sequence, asinteger array
 */
'))
