		(content '/** 
 * This methods returns the author of a given position in the <b>author-datafile</b>.<br> <br> This method is used for creating the literature list, which is displayed in a table in the JTabbedPane of the main window.<br> <br> <b>Caution!</b> The position  {@code pos} is a value from <b>1</b> to{@link #getCount(int) getCount(AUCOUNT)} - in contrary to usual arrayhandling where the range is from 0 to (size-1).
 * @param pos a valid position of an element, ranged from 1 to{@link #getCount(int) getCount(AUCOUNT)}
 * @return the author string or an empty string if nothing was found
 */
'))
