	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 63028)
		(container (ref: 74824))
		(content '/** 
 * This Action creates the links between of the currently displayed entry with all other enries, based on matching keywords. These hyperlinks are stored in the JTable of the JTabbedPane.<br> <br> Unlike the createLinks-task, this task does not look for any single occurences of keywords, but of logical-combination of the selected keywords. I.e., whether <i>all</i> or <i>at least one</i> of the selected keywords is/are part of another entry''s keywords-list.
 * @return the background task
 */
'))
