		(content '/** 
 * This method return the html-header, i.e. the style-definitions, for the export- html-page. in contrary to the main window, where each entry gets its own header, because the html-page in the editorpane consists of just one entry, we have many entries in one editorpane in the desktop-window - but we need the style-definition only once. Thus, this method is seperated from the other method, which creates the html-content of an entry.
 * @param settings
 * @return The style definition for the html-page from the desktop window
 */
'))
