		(container (ref: 85124))
		(content '/** 
 * This method sets an accelerator key of an related action. To change an accelerator key, provide the action''s name and the keystroke-value as string parameters. furthermore, we have to tell the method, to which file the changes should be applied (param what). Following constants should be used as parameters:<br> MAINKEYS<br> NEWENTRYKEYS<br> DESKTOPKEYS<br> SEARCHRESULTSKEYS<br>
 * @param what      (uses constants, see global field definition at top ofsource)
 * @param action    (the action''s name, as string, e.g. "newEntry")
 * @param keystroke (the keystroke, e.g. "ctrl N" (win/linux) or "meta O" (mac)
 */
'))
