	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 78000)
		(container (ref: 85029))
		(content '/** 
 * This method creates a html page of the parameters passed to this class constructor It is easier to keep the overview over the layout style when the html page, which is responsible for the "look''n''feel" of an entry, is being created in a separate class rather than in the CDaten class. <br><br> This method creates the html-content of entries for the desktop window.
 * @param dataObj
 * @param bibtexObj
 * @param settings
 * @param isHeadingVisible
 * @param nr
 * @param zettelcontent
 * @param isEntryNumberVisible
 * @param isExport
 * @param createHtmlFootnotes
 * @return a string with the html-page-content
 */
'))
