	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 79267)
		(container (ref: 82443))
		(content '/** 
 * This dialog displays various export settings that are defined by the user. In this dialog, the user can specify the export-format, which elements of entries should be exported and so on. When the user clicks the apply-button, the dialog will be closed and the settings can be retrieved via the various getter-methods. Usually, this method is called from the main window.
 * @author danielludecke
 */
'))
