	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 84724)
		(container (ref: 101046))
		(content '/** 
 * This method adds a new header/bulletpoint to the desktop (and to the jtree). Bullets differ from "usual" note in such case, that they are allowed to have children - in contrary to nodes that refer to entries, which may not have children. <br> <br> New bullet are always addes to the end of a selected node''s children-list, while a new "entry-node" should be added <b>before</b> bullets. Thus, in a children list, first come all entry-nodes, than all bullet-nodes (always in this order).
 */
'))
