		(content '/** 
 * This method updates the treeview after each change made to the desktop. The changes are only applied to the desktop-data-file (the xml-file managed in the  {@link #desktopObj CDesktop-Class}). This method retrieves the structure from this xml-document and copies it to the treeview.<br> <br> Updating the treeview does <b>not</b> update the display of the entries as well, since many display-updates take much time. Rather the action {@link #updateView() updateView} is enabled, which updates the display.
 */
'))
