	(FAMIX.Comment (id: 93624)
		(container (ref: 73298))
		(content '/** 
 * This method displays the the keyword-clusters, i.e. the relation between keywords and those entries that contain all these related keywords. <br> <br> Therefore, this method first displays all keywords as first-level-elements of the jTreeCluster. Then, when a keyword is selected, this method searches for all entries that contain this keyword and sets the related entry-numbers into the jListCluster. <br> <br> After that, all keywords of those found entries are collected and displayed as children of the selected keyword. This repeats for each selected keyword, i.e. if a children is selected, the method searches for the selected keyword and all parent-keywords in the entries of the jList. All entries, that contain each(!) keyword from the first-level-keyword to the selected child will be displayed in the jList.
 */
'))
