 * @param content         the entry''s content that should be cleaned fromUBB-format-tags
 * @param includeMarkdown if {@code true}, Markdown syntax will also be removed. If  {@code false}, Markdown syntax will remain in the string. This is needed when exporting content into Markdown format and only not supported UBB tags should be removed, but not Markdown.
 * @return a cleaned string of that entry''s content that does no longer containany UBB-Format-tags
 */
'))
